  m_text: "Tomato Tips \n\n1. Plant tomatoes in full sun (6\u20138+ hours) with rich,
    well-draining soil, and space plants to allow good airflow.\n\n2. Water deeply
    and consistently, aiming for moist\u2014not soggy\u2014soil; water at the base
    to avoid wetting the leaves.\n\n3. Feed with a balanced or tomato-specific fertilizer
    and support plants with stakes or cages; prune lower leaves for better airflow
    and healthier growth."
