  m_text: "Tulip Tips\n\n1. Plant tulip bulbs in fall in well-draining soil and a
    spot that gets full or partial sun.\n\n2. Water after planting, then only lightly
    during growth\u2014avoid overwatering, as tulips dislike soggy soil.\n\n3. After
    blooming, let the foliage die back naturally to feed the bulb, and optionally
    dig up and store bulbs in summer if your climate is very wet or hot."
