  m_text: "Poppy Tips \n\n1. Plant poppies in full sun with well-draining soil; they
    prefer poor to average soil and don\u2019t need rich amendments.\n\n2. Water
    sparingly\u2014poppies are drought-tolerant and dislike soggy conditions; let
    the soil dry between waterings.\n\n3. Deadhead spent flowers to extend blooming,
    and allow some seed pods to mature if you want them to reseed naturally."
